	<d:index d:value="make it" d:title="make it" d:parental-control="1" d:anchor="xpointer(//*[@id='make_it'])"/>
	<h1>make</h1>
	<span class="syntax"><span d:pr="US">| māk |</span></span>
	<h2>Definition</h2>
	<ol>
		<li>form (something) by putting parts together; <i>she makes her own clothes</i></li>
		<li>cause (something) to exist or come about.</li>
	</ol>
	<div id="make_it" d:parental-control="1"><b>make it</b>: succeed in something; survive.</div>
	<p d:priority="2">More at <a href="x-dictionary:d:fabricate">fabricate</a>.</p>
</d:entry>
